  giftId: 5
  contentList:
  - I hope you're ready for Christmas!  I do need a portable console. Thanks for
    your understanding.
  - I hope you are having a great day at the North Pole!  I would really love a portable
    console to play wherever I go. It would make every trip magical. Thanks for your
    understanding.
  - "I hope you're excited for Christmas just like I am!  I\u2019m wishing for a
    tiny world I can hold in my hands, where adventures appear on a screen."
